# Safety and workflow

- Read `AGENTS.md` and the next unchecked task in `docs/progress.md` before changing code.
- Use `$TEST_DATABASE_URL` only. Never `DROP`/`TRUNCATE`/`DELETE`/`UPDATE` against `$DATABASE_URL` without explicit human confirmation.
- Parameterized queries only (`Bun.sql` tagged templates or bound params). Quote catalog-validated identifiers; never concatenate untrusted names.
- Snapshot-before-mutation on every write path. Do not mark Phase 3 tasks complete without recorded human tests.
- Do not invent completion. Tracker updates need date, evidence (command), and notes. Generated code is not evidence.
- Do not add a divergent `CLAUDE.md` or copy architecture into per-tool instruction files.
